# Start: a transfer page, focus on SAVES, with ROMS AND BIOS or GAME CONTENT
# on (so the second button reads CONTINUE). End: the systems page, focus on
# its first system row. Four rows down is the button bar on BACK; right is
# CONTINUE; the scan behind the page takes a few seconds, which is what the
# long settle waits out -- the page is static once the systems are listed.
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
key right
wait-for-change
settle
shot continue-focused
key x
wait-for-change 20
settle 30
shot systems-page
